?><!doctype html><html lang="sw"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Lipa kwa Mobile Money — VideoFunds</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><style>body{background:#06101d;color:#fff;font-family:Arial}.box{max-width:520px;margin:45px auto;padding:28px;background:#0d1b2a;border:1px solid #29415c;border-radius:18px}.muted{color:#aebdce}.amount{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#55e0c2}input,button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px}input{background:#091827;color:white;border:1px solid #29415c}button{border:0;background:#55e0c2;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}#msg{color:#ffaaaa}</style></head><body><main class="box"><h1>Malipo ya <?=htmlspecialchars(ucfirst($stage))?></h1><p class="muted">Lipa salama kupitia Mobile Money.</p><div class="amount">TZS <?=number_format($amount)?></div><form id="pay"><label for="phone">Namba ya simu ya Tanzania</label><input id="phone" name="phone" inputmode="tel" placeholder="255712345678 au 0712345678" required><button id="submit" type="submit">TUMA OMBI LA MALIPO</button><p id="msg" role="status"></p></form><p class="muted">Baada ya kutuma ombi, angalia simu yako na uidhinishe malipo. Huduma itaendelea baada ya malipo kuthibitishwa.</p><a href="dashboard.php" class="muted">Rudi dashboard</a></main><script>
const form=document.getElementById('pay'),btn=document.getElementById('submit'),msg=document.getElementById('msg');
form.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();btn.disabled=true;msg.textContent='Inatuma ombi...';let phone=document.getElementById('phone').value.replace(/\D/g,'');if(phone.startsWith('0'))phone='255'+phone.slice(1);if(phone.startsWith('7')||phone.startsWith('6'))phone='255'+phone;try{const r=await fetch('payment-gateway.php',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action:'create',stage:<?=json_encode($stage)?>,phone})});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.message||'Imeshindikana kuanzisha malipo');location.href='payment-pending.php?stage='+encodeURIComponent(<?=json_encode($stage)?>)+'&ref='+encodeURIComponent(d.reference);}catch(err){msg.textContent=err.message;btn.disabled=false;}});
</script></body></html>
